   "widgets_values": [
     "# Advanced MiniMax-H3 AV workflow / MiniMax-H3 音视频高级工作流\n\n**English:** H3 generates video and 32 kHz stereo audio together, including dialogue, ambience, and music. This archived workflow uses the `int8_convrot` text encoder, exposes `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift`, builds a three-field H3-Context-IR prompt, and saves a separate audio track.\n\n**简体中文：** H3 会同时生成视频和 32 kHz 立体声音频，包括对白、环境音和配乐。此归档工作流使用 `int8_convrot` 文本编码器，开放 `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift`，构建三字段 H3-Context-IR 提示词，并单独保存音轨。\n\n## Prompt structure / 提示词结构\n\nKeep these field names unchanged / 请保持以下字段名不变：\n\n- `integrated_multimodal_description:` — shots, subjects, actions, and timing / 镜头、主体、动作和时间点\n- `overall_soundscape:` — on-screen ambience and action sounds / 画面内的环境音和动作音\n- `non_diegetic_music:` — off-screen score / 画面外的配乐\n\nDialogue / 对白：`<d>[English] Secure the boats.</d>`\n\nSeparate shots with `[Shot 1]`, `[Shot 2]`, and add timing such as `At 00:03.500,`. / 使用 `[Shot 1]`、`[Shot 2]` 分隔镜头，并用 `At 00:03.500,` 等格式标记时间。"
    ],
    "title": "Workflow overview / 工作流概览"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
