   "widgets_values": [
     "## Model constraints / 模型限制\n\n**English**\n\n- Frame count must satisfy `n % 17 == 5`: `5, 22, 39, ... 362`.\n- About 5 s = 124 frames, 7 s = 175, 10 s = 243, and 15 s = 362.\n- The documented trained range is about 124–362 frames; values outside it are unverified.\n- Width and height must be multiples of 32. The documented native short edge is 768 and trained area is about `768*1344`.\n- Use `BasicGuider` for CFG-distilled weights. The official defaults are `res_multistep`, `simple`, 20 steps, `shift_video=12.0`, and `shift_audio=3.0`.\n\n**简体中文**\n\n- 帧数必须满足 `n % 17 == 5`：`5, 22, 39, ... 362`。\n- 约 5 秒 = 124 帧、7 秒 = 175 帧、10 秒 = 243 帧、15 秒 = 362 帧。\n- 文档中的训练范围约为 124–362 帧，范围外尚未验证。\n- 宽高必须是 32 的倍数。文档中的原生短边为 768，训练面积约为 `768*1344`。\n- CFG-distilled 权重应使用 `BasicGuider`。官方默认值为 `res_multistep`、`simple`、20 步、`shift_video=12.0` 和 `shift_audio=3.0`。"
    ],
    "title": "Model constraints / 模型限制"
  },
  {
