   "widgets_values": [
     "## Archived single-machine result / 归档的单机结果\n\n**English:** These measurements describe one RTX 3090 24 GB system only. They are not a performance promise for other hardware. At 832x480, 124 frames, and 20 steps, the measured runtime was 9.4 minutes, peak VRAM was 20.2/24 GB, and remaining system RAM was 1.6/31.8 GB. The output was H.264 832x480 at 24 fps with AAC 32 kHz stereo audio, 5.167 seconds long. Only the 0.4 MP setting was tested.\n\nThe text encoder and DiT together exceeded available system RAM, so this machine was started with `--disable-smart-memory`. A CUDA or PyTorch stack change can affect speed and compatibility; do not treat it as a required setup step.\n\n**简体中文：** 这些测量结果仅来自一台 RTX 3090 24 GB 机器，不代表其他硬件的性能。在 832x480、124 帧、20 步时，实测耗时 9.4 分钟，VRAM 峰值为 20.2/24 GB，系统内存剩余 1.6/31.8 GB。输出为 H.264 832x480、24 fps，搭配 AAC 32 kHz 立体声音频，时长 5.167 秒。仅测试了 0.4 MP 设置。\n\n文本编码器和 DiT 的总内存需求超过此机器可用的系统内存，因此启动时使用了 `--disable-smart-memory`。更改 CUDA 或 PyTorch 环境会影响速度和兼容性，不应视为必需步骤。"
    ],
    "title": "Single-machine result / 单机结果"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
