   "widgets_values": [
     "## Generation modes / 生成模式\n\n**English**\n\n- **T2VA:** Keep both Load Image nodes muted with Ctrl+M.\n- **FL2VA:** Enable `first_frame`, `last_frame`, or both. The first frame stretches to the canvas; the last frame uses proportional cropping, so match the source aspect ratio when possible.\n- **Ref2VA:** Change the checkpoint to `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` and use `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo`. It accepts up to 9 images, 3 videos, and 3 audio clips, with no more than 12 files total. Refer to them as `<Picture 1>`, `<Video 1>`, and `<Audio 1>` in the prompt. `ref_image_size=max` improves identity preservation but increases sampling cost.\n\n**简体中文**\n\n- **T2VA：** 使用 Ctrl+M 保持两个 Load Image 节点静音。\n- **FL2VA：** 启用 `first_frame`、`last_frame` 或同时启用。首帧会直接拉伸到画布，尾帧使用等比裁剪，因此应尽量让源图比例与输出比例一致。\n- **Ref2VA：** 将模型改为 `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`，并使用 `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo`。最多支持 9 张图片、3 段视频和 3 段音频，总文件数不超过 12。请在提示词中使用 `<Picture 1>`、`<Video 1>` 和 `<Audio 1>` 引用。`ref_image_size=max` 可提高身份保真度，但会增加采样成本。"
    ],
    "title": "Generation modes / 生成模式"
  },
